      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WATERMAIN LADY (7) resumes from a spell of six months after closing off last campaign with three straight wins, the latest at Menangle. Has to contend with a wide draw but has been readied with two trial wins and has won two of three previous fresh attempts. SEASIDE SID (8) led to beat a smart field in the Canola Cup last month and made it two in succession when he came from the back row and got the cash by 4 metres at Bathurst last time. That was his first attempt at this distance range and he is going well enough to overcome a very wide draw. MESSERATI (4) is on the radar after coming from this barrier for fourth in a higher-graded race here last time. KAITOA (5) draws lower than in the last start second and could be close to a win following a string of top-four results here.",
